    72→    //
    73→    // 1. We have the parent stored in our database. Because fork-choice has confirmed the
    74→    //    parent is *not* in our post-finalization DAG, all other blocks must be either
    75→    //    pre-finalization or conflicting with finalization.
    76→    // 2. The parent is unknown to us, we probably want to download it since it might actually
